      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 3,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "4eb30a6c-a081-4e24-b0c0-b9de0ba9af4c",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.output.relevant }}",
              "rightValue": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.3
    },
    {
      "id": "fc267203-1411-45a7-9d22-d591a83a2038",
      "name": "Secondary LLM Processing Chain",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        2080,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are an AI news analyst.\n\nAnalyze this important AI news article.\n\nARTICLE TITLE:\n{{ $('Limit to 10 Items').item.json.title }}\n\nARTICLE DESCRIPTION:\n{{ $('Limit to 10 Items').item.json.contentSnippet }}\n\nARTICLE URL:\n{{ $('Limit to 10 Items').item.json.link }}\n\nThe previous classifier already determined that this is important AI news.\n\nAnalyze it and explain:\n\n1. What happened?\n2. What new AI model, tool, product, or technology is involved?\n3. What is actually new?\n4. What is coming next?\n5. How could this affect humans?\n6. How could this affect jobs?\n7. How could this affect developers?\n8. Why should people care?\n9. What could happen in the future?\n10. What is the strongest angle for a social media carousel?\n\nReturn ONLY the requested structured output.\nDo not use Markdown.\nDo not add explanations outside the requested fields.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nClearly distinguish confirmed facts from predictions or speculation.\nNever present rumors, assumptions, or predictions as confirmed facts.\nIf the article does not provide evidence for a claim, say that it is a possibility or prediction.\nDo not invent AI model names, release dates, prices, capabilities, or company plans.\nOnly use information supported by the article.",
        "batching": {},
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.9
    },
